# GARP Scoring

## Style preset: `garp`

| Dimension | Weight |
|-----------|--------|
| Thesis integrity | 25% |
| Valuation attractiveness | 25% |
| Fundamental momentum | 20% |
| Catalyst proximity | 15% |
| Technical trend | 15% |

## Thresholds (from profile.yaml)

- Min buy score: **60**
- Swap delta required: **15** (candidate − holding)
- Flag for review: holding score **< 50**

## MCP routing

| Task | MCP |
|------|-----|
| `score_tickers` | Rebalance-MCP |
| `compare_swaps`, `run_backtest` | Rebalance-MCP |
| Live quotes | FinanceKit |
| SEC, earnings, screener | Equibles |
| Monte Carlo, Sharpe | Portfolio-MCP |

## Rotation rules

- Re-score holdings weekly
- Swap only when delta >= 15 AND valuation check passes (P/E vs 5-yr avg, PEG)
- Trim positions exceeding 20% weight
- Never chase momentum without valuation guardrail

## Screener (monthly)

Equibles screener: profitable, P/E < 40, revenue growth > 15%. Max 3 new candidates into `watchlist.yaml` screener_slots.
